flowchart TD
    A[Start Solve] --> B[Validate words and attempts]

    B -->|Invalid| C[Throw validation error]
    B -->|Valid| D[Create empty filtered list]

    D --> E[Iterate over each word]
    E --> F[Set isValid = true]

    F --> G[Iterate over each attempt]
    G --> H[Count positional matches with guess]

    H --> I{matches == attempt.matches?}
    I -->|No| J[Mark word invalid and break]
    I -->|Yes| K[Continue]

    K --> L{More attempts?}
    L -->|Yes| G
    L -->|No| M{Word remains valid?}

    M -->|Yes| N[Add word to filtered list]
    M -->|No| O[Skip word]

    N --> P{More words?}
    O --> P
    P -->|Yes| E
    P -->|No| Q{Filtered list empty?}

    Q -->|Yes| R[Throw error: no candidates remain]
    Q -->|No| S[Return filtered list]
    S --> T[End]